WEBVTT

00:11:57.225 --> 00:12:01.905
or you could be facing different types
of limitation in your life:

00:12:01.929 --> 00:12:03.356
professionally,

00:12:03.380 --> 00:12:04.572
financially,

00:12:04.596 --> 00:12:05.851
academically

00:12:05.875 --> 00:12:07.792
or even physically.

00:12:08.749 --> 00:12:13.115
I want to remind you that,
in striving for bigger goals,

00:12:13.139 --> 00:12:15.649
dare to take small sprints.

00:12:17.471 --> 00:12:21.959
These sprints are usually
far from excellent themselves,

00:12:21.983 --> 00:12:25.206
but they add up to magnificent results.

00:12:26.586 --> 00:12:27.896
Thank you.